  "body": "## Problem\n\nPR #3857 (merged) says that its red `pocket3d_hsm` heavy count (4688, 4660, 1980) predates its review fix, not the PR. But HSM hops now go through `reenter`, so the PR may cause the drift. If so, the heavy lane `app heavy: pocket3d_hsm` is red on `main`, and only the next cut gate would see it.\n\n## Action\n\n- Run `cargo xtask gate release --only \"app heavy: pocket3d_hsm\"` on `main` after #3857, and on the commit before it.\n- If the step is red on `main` and green before, #3857 caused it: decide if the new count is correct motion (update the reading with proof) or a defect (fix it).\n- Report the result here.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Follow-up from a second review of #3857. P2: a heavy lane that may be red on `main`.\n",
